<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Dai-Chin: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philipih</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIPIHEA veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philipih</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phi</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIPIHEA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Veia Pawluha Cayuk</para>
  <para style="imt">Pyenhlüma</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Philipihea veia Pawluha Kca Yuk</char> hin Pawluh naw Europah khawmdeka a mdüih ma kcük Philipih Sangcima veia a yuka kyaki. Philipih cun Romah khaw k’uma veki Maketawnih khaw üngka mlüha kyaki. Khritjan mkhawng akce he naw kpet u lü Philipih Sangcim üng mtheinak akkhya hea phäh puksetsak se, thawngim üng a kyum k’um üng a jah yuka kyaki. Cunüngpi ahina kca naw Pawluh a jekyainak ja mkhühüpnak taki ti ngdangsaki. Jekyainak ja mkhühüpnak cun Jesuh Khritaw üng Pawluh a jumeinak kcang däk naw ni a jah mtheh ngkhai thei kawm.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ahunata kca a jah yuknaka suilam ta Pawluh naw kpüikpak vai a hlüeia kcün üng Philipih Sangcim naw ngui kbi u se yah lü, jenak a jah mtheh be vaia phäh ni. Amät ja Philipih sangcim khyange khuikhat mpyenset pha kyaw u lü pi käh pukse ktha ngcek lü linglainak am ami ve vaia a jah mthehnaka kyaki. Kummu kamvanak ja mlunga dämnak hawih lü Bawi Jesuha kba mlung ami mhnem vaia jah nghui naki. Jesuh am yümmat lü xünsak kthai yahei cun Pamhnama bäkhäknak ti ksing u lü, acuna bäkhäknak ami yahei cun pi Judah khawning Thum ami läklam xünseipüia phäh am ni lü, Khritaw jumeinaka phäh ni ti cun jah sümsaki. Khritaw üng yümmatnak üng xüngseikie am Pamhnam naw jekyainak ja dimdeihnak pekia mawng yuki.</para>
  <para style="ip">Khritjanea jumeinak ja mhnüp tä ami xünsak üng jekyainak, mkhühüpnak, yümmatnak ja, Khritjan jumeinak ja xünsak am ami ve laihlaih vaie cun aktunga a yuka kcaa kyaki. Philipih sangcima khana Pawluha mhlämcehnak täkia mawng cun ahina kca üng angsingtea mi hmu yahki.</para>
  <para style="iot">Amawng Ktawie</para>
  <para style="io1">Pyenhlüma <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pawluha jah hmuhtheh sawngtawhe <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jesuh üngkhyüh xünnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1:27—2:18</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Timoti ja Epharodiha phäh nümyane <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yee ja Kyühkyawk ksee phäh mcuhmcäinak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pawluh ja Philipih mlüha ka a nglawipüi he <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khüpnak <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:12">Ngs 16:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Jesuh Khritawa mpya, Pawluh ja Timoti naw,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 1:1">Philipih mlüha awmki he Jesuh Khritaw üng pumat lü Pamhnam jumeikie, sangcim mkhawnge ja ning jah kpüikpakie mahmaha:<verse eid="PHP 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Mi Pa Pamhnam ja Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw naw bäkhäknak ja dimdeihnak ning jah pe se.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Philipihea phäh Pawluha ktaiyünak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Nangmi ka ning jah süm naküt üng, nangmia phäh Ka Pamhnam ka jenaki. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Nangmi avana phäha ka ktaiyü naküt üng jekyainak am ka ktaiyüki. <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>Isetiakyaküng thangkdawa phäh khut pawhnak üng acuteinak üngkhyüh tuh vei cäpa nami na kpüikpak ua phäh ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Ahina khut kdaw nangmi üng cuteiki Pamhnam naw a ngpäng vei, Jesuh Khritawa Khawmhnüp apha law vei cäpa bilo ktäi khai, tia ka jumeiki. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Alä se ka mlungmthin üng ka ning jah sümki. Nangmia phäh ahikba ka ngaih hin ka phäha dawki. Isetikyaküng, Pamhnama na peta khut na kpüikpak u lü, thawngima ka ve üng pi ni se, thangkdaw saksi na lü acuna thangkdaw ka khängsak üng pi ni se, nami na kpüikpaka phäh ka ning jah süm nglätki ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Jesuh Khritawa mhläkphyanak am ihlawka nami van ka ning jah hmu hlüki ti cun Pamhnam naw na ksingki ni. Aktäa ning jah hmu hlü lü ka khamei hin Khritaw Jesuh üngkhyüh lawkia kyaki ni.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Nami mhläkphyanak cun themngvainak kcang ja ngthumkhyahnak ngdüng am atänga a däm law bawkbawk vaia, <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>Acunakyase, akdaw säih cun nami xüei thei khaie. Acunüng va, am ngcimcaihnak ja Khritawa law be Mhnüp üng, mkateinak naküt üngkhyüh nami lät khaie. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Pamhnama bungming a hlüngtainak vaia, Jesuh Khritaw däk naw ngsungpyunnaka ktheipaia nami xünsak ngtheipaisak khaia, ka ning jah ktaiyü petki ni.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Xünnak vai ta Khritaw ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Ka benae aw, ka khana pha lawki naküt hin thangkdaw ngthang hüsak dämki ti nami ksing vai ka ngja hlüki. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Ngs 28:30</ref></char></note>Acunakyase, Khritawa mpyaa ka thawna phäh thawngim üng ami na khyum hin bawingawhnak mtätki avan ja ahia veki avana veia ngthang hü päihki ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Jumeikie naw kei thawngim üng ami na khyuma phäh Bawipa üng mkhühüpnak dämdäm yah u lü, thangkdaw ami sanga kcün naküt üng käh kyühei lang lü linglainak dämdäm jah peki.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Khyang akhäk naw püi mkeinak ja hnengnak mlung am Khritawa mawng sangkie ni. Cunüngpi akce he naw ta ami mlungkaw kcang am sangkie ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Thangkdaw cun cangki ti lü sang khaia kei hin Pamhnam naw khut na petki ti cun amimi naw ksing u lü, thangkdaw cun k’üna lü mhläkphyanak am sangkie. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Ami mlung ngcim üng am ni lü, thawngim üng kyum lü ka khuikha law dämdäm khaia, ami na hnengnak üng thangkdaw sangkie ni.<verse eid="PHP 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Aiakyase pi ka jeki ni. Khritawa thangkdaw cun akdaw lam üng pi ni se, akse lam üng pi ni se sangkie ni. Acuna phäh atuh ka jekyaiki. Ka jekyai laihlaih khai. <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>Nami ktaiyünak ja Jesuh Khritawa Ngmüimkhya üngkhyüh lawki kpüikpaknake naw kei cun na lätlangsak khai. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Ka hlükawei ja äpeinak naw am na ngkekhyakeisak. Cunüng pi, ka thih üng pi kyase, ka xün üng pi kyase, atuh pi kyase ngawia pi kyase, linglainak am Khritaw cun ka pumsa naw mhlünmtai nglät khai. <verse eid="PHP 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Xünnak ta i ni? Keia phäh ta xünnak hin Khritaw ni. Thih üngpi dawnak bawk ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Cunsepi, pumsa üng ka xüng laihlaih üng, ka ngtheipai dämdäm khawhki. Acunsepi hawn ka xü vai am ksing veng. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Ka mlung nghngih kthum lü haw da ceh vai am ksing veng. Khawmdek hin ngkyapüi lü Khritaw üng ve yüm vai ka ngja hlüki. Acun cun ka phäha daw bawki ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Cunüngpi, nangmia phäh ka xün vai hlü bawki ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Nangmi jumeinak am jekyai lü nami dämduh law vaia nami hlawnga ka ve khai ti ka ksing ngkhaiki ni. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Acunakyase, nami veia ka law betü üng, Khritaw Jesuh üng pummat lü keia phäh nami awhcah law bawkbawk khaie.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Aktung bawka ta nami awmih ngneisak Khritawa thangkdaw üng a ngkäk vai hlüki. Nami veia law lü ning jah teng law ngü sepi, am law be lü athuknaka ka ve üngpi, ngkhängkia mlung mat am ngdüi yüm lü thangkdaw jumeinak am ngtäknak nami pawh yüm vai u ka ngja hlüki. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Nami yee käh jah kyühei ua. Aläa linglai u lü acun naw amimi sum u lü, nangmi nami ngnängki ti mdan khai ni. Isetiüng ngnängnak ning jah peki cun Pamhnama kyaki. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Ani jumeinak däk üng am ni lü ania phäh khuikha nami khamei hin Khritawa khut pawh khaia kcün kdaw a ning jah peta nami kyaki. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Ngs 16:19-40</ref></char></note>Atuh ta kei am atänga ngtuknaka nami ngpüikie ni. Ahlana ngtuk ka pawh nami hmu khawikie. Nami ngjaka kba acuna jumeinak ngtuk üng ka veei hamki ni.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Khritawa mlung mhnemnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Khritaw üng nami xüngsei naw ning jah kyansaisak lü a mhläkphyanak naw ning jah mhlawhmcahki. Ngmüimkhya üng nglawiei uki lü mat naw mata khana mpyenmsei k’ük’awmnak nami taki he. <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Nami cungngaih täng lü ngmüimkhya ja mlungkaw üng mat lü, tängkia mhläkphyanak ta lü yümmat uki se, keia jenak a kümcei vaia phäh ka ning jah cüki. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Mäta cängtai dawkyanak vai ja camcahnak vai däka i pi käh pawh u bä. Cunüngpi khyangkce hin nanga kthaka dawki tia aläa sim lü mat ja mata khana mlung mhnemnak ta u bä. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Namimäta phäh däka käh khüi lü nami püia dawnak vai pi pawh u bä. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Jesuh Khritawa mlungkawa kba mlungkaw na ua.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Khritaw cun Mhnam kcanga kyaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:6">cunüngpi Pamhnam üng asihlinga ngteh law khaia am cumcak khawi.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>Acuna nghngün üng, anaküt cun hawih lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">mpya ning xüeiki.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Nghngicima mäiha thawn law lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">nghngicima lupla üng ngdang lawki.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>A mlung mhnem lü a thihnak vai cäpa mtheh ngjaki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">Kutlamktunga a thih vai cäpa.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Acuna phäha Pamhnam naw akhlüng säiha hnün üng mhlünmtai lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">ngming naküta kthaka ngming akdäm säih a pet.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10,11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Hesa 45:23</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note>Acunakyase, Jesuha ngming leisawng lü</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">khankhawa awmki he, khawmdeka awmki he ja khawmdeka kea awmki he naküt naw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">ami mkhuk am ngdäng law u lü,<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Mlei naküt naw “Jesuh Khritaw hin Bawi ni” ti lü ng’anei law u lü,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">Pa Pamhnama hlüngtainak mdan khaie.<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aisia mäiha vaikhang vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Acunakyase ka püi he aw, nami hlawnga ka ve ham üng ka mtheh aläa nami ngjak khawia kba, tukbäih athuknaka ka ve k’um üng ka mtheh nami ngjak vai hlü bawk ve. Nami küikyannak akümcei law vaia ngkhyet lü kyüheinak am mtunei u bä. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Isetiakyaküng, Pamhnam naw ania titäng cun kcang na lü nami yüco khaia alä se nami mlung k’uma khut pawhki.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Ai nami pawh üngpi ngtekkhaihnak ja ngcuhngkaihnak am käh pawh u bä. <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Deut 32:5</ref></char></note>Acunüng va mkhyekie ja limma hleihlakkia khawmdek khyangea ksunga Pamhnama ca khyang ngcim kcanga nami kya khai. Xünnaka ngthu nami jah petkia kyase, aisie naw khankhaw ami kcäiha mäiha ami ksunga nami vaikhang vai. <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>Khritaw a kyum law bea Mhnüp üng, nangmi ka ning jah awhcahnak khai. Isetiüng ka ngjuktha naküt ja ka khut bi naküt cun amdanga am kya tia acun naw mdan law khai.<verse eid="PHP 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Nami jumnak Pamhnam üng pet ngkengnaka khana ka thi msawi vai a ni üng pi, kei cun je lü nangmi pi avan kei am atänga nami jekyai hnga khai. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Acuna mäiha ni, nangmi pi jekyai ua. Kei üng pi jekyai ua.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti ja Epharodih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Bawipa naw a hlüei üng ta sängsäng se nami veia Timoti ka tüih law khaia ka ngaiki. Acunüng va, nami thang ngja lü ktha ka ning jah pe thei khai. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Keia khamei na khampüi lü nangmi pi ning jah mceimsangki ta Timoti däk ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Khyang naküt naw Jesuh Khritawa phäh käh suilei u lü animäta phäh suileikie ni. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Timoti cun ia mäih khyang ni ti cun nami ksing pängki. A pa ja a ca ngpanacaa mäiha, ani am atänga thangkdawa phäh khut kani pawhki. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Ka khana ihawkba a thawn law vai ka ksing ja nami veia ka tüi law khaia ka ngaiki. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Sängsäng se nami veia kamät kung ka law khawh khai tia Bawipa ka jumki.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>Ka peia khut pawh lü jumeinak ngtuk pawhki, kei na kuei lü nami ngsäa thawnki kani na Epharodih nami veia tüih law vai hlüki tia ka ngaiki. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Nami van ning jah hmu hlü dütki. Ani am yaiki tia a thang nami ngjaka phäh aktäa vedamki. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Akcanga ta thi khyäü awngkia ani am yai. Cunüngpi ani mpyeneiki Pamhnam naw ani däk mpyeneiki am ni. Ania phäh ka pukset law dämdäm vai am hlüei lü kei pi na mpyeneiki. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Nami hmuh üng nami je betü vai ua phäh ja ka puksetnak a khyüh vaia phäh, nami veia ani tüih law hlah vai ka hlüeiki. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Bawipa üng benaa kyase, jekyainak am dokham ua. Ania mäih khyang naküt pi jah leisawng ua. <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>Isetiüng ta, ani naw am nami na kuei khawha phäh na kuei lü Khritawa khuta phäh thi khyäü awnga a sak peki.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ngsungpyunnak akcang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Ka benae aw, akpäihnaka ka pyen hlü betü ta, Bawipa üng nami yümmatnak am jekyai ua. Maa ka yuk päng ka yuk be be vai am mhmanei ngü. Ka yuk be be üngpi nangmia üpawmnak vai ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Ami mtisa mawih vaia pyen lü, akse pawhkia khyange uie cen jah mceiei u bä. <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Vun mawih akcang yaheiki ta amimi am ni, mimi ni. Isetiüng Pamhnam cun ngmüimkhya üng sawkhah lü Khritaw Jesuh am mi awhcah jekyaikie. Akhawkpunga bilawh üng am mi jumei u. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Khyanga bilawhe ka jah ümpa na khawhki. Khyang kce he naw akhawkpunga khyanga bilawhe jah ümna khaia a ngaihei üng, kei üng sehlen lü jah ümnak vai veki. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Ngs 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref></char></note>Khawmhnüp khyüh ka law üng vun ka mawiki. Kei Isarel khyangmjü, Benjamin pasanga ka kyaki. Hebru khyangmjü kcanga pi ka kyaki. Judah Thum üng asängei üng pi kei Pharisea ka kyaki. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Ngs 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note>Judah Khawning ktha na lü sangcim ka jah mkhuimkha khawiki. Thum läklamki a ngsungpyun üng ta, kei üng ia mkhyenak am ve. <verse eid="PHP 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Cunüngpi cängtainaka ka jah ngaihe naküt cun Khritaw üng ka jah sumpaknaka ka ngaiki. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Acun he däk am ni; ka Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw ksingnak hin aphu küi säihki tia ksing lü anaküt ka hawih ni. Acun he naküt cun Khritaw yahei vaia phäha jah hawih lü, anaküt cun phyawksaka ni ka jah ngaih. Anaküta kthaka ka hlüei ta Khritawa kya lü, <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>Ani üng avana ka ngdawnki. Thum ka läklama phäh kei üng ngsungpyunnak am ve. Tukbäih ta jumnaka khana ngdüi lü Pamhnam üngkhyüh lawkia ngsungpyunnak, Khritaw jumnak üngkhyüh lawki ngsungpyunnak ka taki. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Ka ngjak hlü naküt cun: Khritaw ksing vai, a thawhnak bea johit hmuhtheh sawngtawh vai, a khameinak khameipüi lü thihnak a khameia kba ka khamei hnga vai ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Thihnak üngkhyüh xünnaka äpeinak am ka tho be khai.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bünak cäpa dawng vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Cunsepi ka yah pängki, ka kümcei pängki ka tinak hlü am ni. Ngkhyengnak yah khaia ka kthanak hin Jesuh Khritaw naw a na man kyeta phäh ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>Ka benae aw, akcanga ta acun ka yah pängkia am ngaiei veng. Cunüngpi, ka bi ta; ka hnua veki mhnih lü ka maa veki cun ka kpha vaia ka khyaih khawha akdawsäiha ka pawhki. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Acunakyase, ngkhyengnak ka yah vaia phäh ka bünak da ka dawng nglätki ni. Acun cun Pamhnam naw khankhaw ngkhyengnak ka yah khaia Jesuh Khritaw üng na khüki ni.<verse eid="PHP 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Ngmüimkhya üng xüxam pängki mimi abäng naw mlungkaw mat takei vai hlüki. Cunüngpi akhäka mlungkaw a hngalang üng, Pamhnam naw angkhaia ning jah ksingsak khai. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Aiakyasepi, tuh vei cäp mi läklam lawa thum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jah läklam vai khyütame cun Mosia thum am ni.</char></note> mat üng mi cit nglät kawm u.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Kor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11:1</ref></char>
    </note>Ka benae aw, na ngcuhngkih na ua. Akdawa ve khaia kami jah mtheia awmih ninga kba awmih ua. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Ahlana khawvei ka ning jah mtheh khawi, atuh pi ka miktui am pyen betü veng: ami kcünsak üng Khritawa thihnak Kutlamktunga yea kyaki akda awmki he. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Amimi cun cimpyehnak mulai meia pha khaie, isetiüng ami mtisa hlü mhnamnakie. Ami ngkeeinak vai sü awhcahnakie. Khawmdeka khawhthem cim mlungnakie. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Acunüngpi, mimi ta khankhaw khyanga mi kya lü khankhaw üngkhyüh law khai jah küikyanki Bawipa Jesuh Khritaw mi mtätkie ni. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Ani naw a uknaka kea avan taknak khawha johit üng thi theikia mi pumsa hin pi hlüngtai dawkyakia a pumsaa mäiha pyang khai.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Mcuhmthehnake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Acunakyase, ka benae aw, ihlawka ka ning jah mhläkphyanaki, ihlawka ka ning jah sümki, ihlawka nami na jekyaisaki, ihlawka ka ning jah pakhyapnaki ni. Ka mhläkphyanaka ka benae aw, ahikba kunga Bawipa üng nami xünsak ngkhängceksak ua.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Evawdih ja Saitekhe xawi aw, Bawipa üng cinaa kba nami ngkhawt be vaia ning jah nghui na veng. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Sitihkia ka khüikhawmpüi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">a khüikhawmpüia ngming ta “Sicikas (Syzygus)” a kyaki.</char></note>, nang pi hina nghnumi xawi ani yümmat thei vaia jah kpüikpaka; thangkdaw sangnak üng Kalemen mahmaha na mtuneipüiki xawi ja ka khüipüi he, Pamhnam xünnak caup üng ami ngming ng’yukie pi pakie ni.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Bawipa üng yümmat lü jekyai nglät ua. Ka pyen hlü betü ta: jekyai ua.<verse eid="PHP 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Khyang naküta veia hniphnawikia mlungkaw mdan ua. Bawipa cun asäng üng law be khai. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>I pi käh cäicing na ua, cunüngpi jekyainak mlungthin am alä se täsam ua, nami hlükaw cun Pamhnam üng alä se nami ktaiyünak üng täsam ua. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Acunüng ta nghngicima themnak naw am a ksing khawha Pamhnama dimdeihnak naw, Khritaw Jesuh ja nangmia yümmata phäh üng nami mlungthin ja cumcaknake cun ning jah yungkaih khai ni.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Ka benae aw, akpäihnaka dawkya lü mhlünmtai ngkawihki: cangnak, dawkyanak, lawingkawihnak, ngcingcaihnak, mhläkphyanak phyaki ja leisawng phyakie üng nami mlung kümbesak u bä. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Ka pyen ja ka ngneisake üngkhyüh ka veia nami yah ja nami ngthei cen mikhmuha xünsei na u bä. Acunüng dimdeihnak jah peki Pamhnam naw ning jah vepüi khai.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Letsawnga phäh jenak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Khawvei pipi a ngsawk käna nami na mceimsang yah betü ua phäh Bawipa üng aktäa ka jekyaiki. Am nami na mceimsang tia phäh ka pyen am ni. Kei nami na mceimsangnak vaia kcün am nami yahei ua phäh ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Nami na hnusunga phäh ka pyen am ni, ka takca am ka xüngsei thei vaia ka ngtheingthanga phäh ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>I hlüki ti ja i takei bawk vai hlüki ti ka ksingki. Kei naw ka ngthei ta: ei ka phü üngpi ni se, ka cawixai üngpi ni se, ka mpya üngpi ni se, ka bawimang üngpi ni se, ahawia pi ni se, ai ti üngpi ni se, ka ngnüngseng theikia kyase ka ve theiki. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Khritaw naw a na peta johit üng ahmäi nängnak khawh vaia ngjuktha ka taki.<verse eid="PHP 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Acunsepi, ka khuikhata kcün üng nami na kpüikpak hin aktäa nami dawnak ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15,16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Kor 11:9</ref></char></note>Nangmi Philipihe, Maketawnih khaw üngkhyüh cit lü thangkdaw nami ksunga ka sang hü kcük üng, petnak üng na kueikia sangcim cun nangmi däk ni; ka dawkyanak ja ka sumpaknak na khameipüiki cun nangmi däk ni, ti nami ksingki. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Ngs 17:1</ref></char></note>Thesalonikah mlüha ve lü kpüinak ka hlüeia kcün üngpi, ahun däk am ni lü nghngih kthum vei nami na kbi lawkie. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Acun cun yahnak vai ka suiki am ni, nami ngui xüi khawhthem a pungpyahnak vaia phäh ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Ex 29:18</ref></char></note>Nami na kbi law naküt ka yahki ti ning jah yuk law veng. Ka hlükawa kthaka hläiei ve. Nami na pet naküt Epharodih naw law se ka hlü naküt yah veng. Acun he cun Pamhnam veia ngkengnak ng’uinghnama thawn lü Pamhnam jesaki ni. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Ka Pamhnam cun bawimangnak am kümceikia kyase, Jesuh Khritaw üngkhyüh nami hlükaw naküt cun ning jah pe se. <verse eid="PHP 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Mi Pamhnam ja mi Pa veia angsäia hlüngtai se! Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Akpäihnaka hnuksetnak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Pamhnama caa thawn lü Khritaw Jesuha hnu läki he naküt yai lü ve u se. Ka hlawnga veki benae naw pi ning jah hnukset ve u. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Pamhnama khyang naküt naw ning jah hnukset ve u. Asükyüa Empero bawi im üngkae naw ning jah hnukset ve u.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Bawipa Jesuh Khritawa bäkhäknak nami khana ve se.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
